                      The Last Ember Ninja           By: subhaan
-----------------------------------------------------------

In a hidden village surrounded by volcanoes, a young ninja named Ren could create tiny sparks from his hands. While others mastered powerful fire techniques, Ren was mocked for producing only weak embers.
One day, a massive storm threatened to destroy the village's sacred flame, the source of their protection. The strongest ninjas failed because their giant fire attacks were blown away by the wind.
Ren quietly walked to the flame and used thousands of tiny embers to keep it alive throughout the night. By sunrise, the storm had passed.
The village learned that true strength is not always the loudest power—it is the determination to never let hope die.
